#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "Compatibilité des fonctionnalités {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the "
"appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the "
"selected feature:\n"
msgstr ""
"Certaines fonctionnalités de runtime ne peuvent pas être utilisées ensemble "
"dans un seul job. Clique sur l'onglet approprié pour obtenir la liste des "
"fonctionnalités incompatibles avec la fonctionnalité sélectionnée :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Might not work when using custom gates. Incompatible with:\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible avec :\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Peut ne pas fonctionner avec des portes personnalisées. Incompatible avec :\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible avec :\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Autres remarques :\n"
"  - Le measurement twirling ne peut être appliqué qu'aux mesures terminales.\n"
"  - Ne fonctionne pas avec les entangleurs non-Clifford.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible avec :\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible avec :\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

